\\n## 范围与交付\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n真实总线服务/对象/方法/错误、请求期限、权限及名称所有权按XML互操作；两profile使用同一封装。\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n首条业务采用现有温度只读切片；只读刷新表示请求采样，不增加加热、运动、OTA或打印控制。完整模块登记实现/未实现/后续状态，不为未实现模块启动空进程后声称功能完成。\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## 正反验收与边界\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n正例：真实总线服务/对象/方法/错误、请求期限、权限及名称所有权按XML互操作；两profile使用同一封装。\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n负例：名称丢失、对端重启、越权、超时、重复调用与背压按契约处理；调用返回不冒充设备完成。\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n所有运行证据须绑定源码commit与dirty diff、构建日志、制品/配置/契约哈希及实际环境。VM真实应用、隔离测试替身、真实MC/TH HIL、SoC实板四类分别登记。\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## 开工与闭环\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n本卡为Backlog计划，未登记真实作者/检查会话、有效租约和候选输入；当前不是开工许可。Ready前按输入版本、写范围、独立检查、工作区/输出目录、资源排他及可执行验证命令逐项落实。\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n依赖卡Done只表示其原范围，消费时须绑定准确接受版本、证据和限制；不继承被撤回或超范围签署。若无须改旧实现，也须提交准确复用矩阵及适用验证，不以空实现自动关闭。\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n实现Owner负责本范围及卡内函数拆分；新增函数≤50行、≤4参。共享CMake/配置/生成输出由既定Owner串行改动并登记精确白名单，其他卡提交接口需求，不并发抢写。\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n作者提交候选 → COORD安排必需独立检查（QA、ARCH）→ 必要真实环境验证 → COORD核对报告/制品哈希与收件 → 按实际范围推进状态。QA作者的预期、工具、报告必须由非作者ARCH独立复核；角色和计划别名不是已启动会话。\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n硬件使用和操作授权沿用现行HW-G及软硬件交接规范；此文档更新不执行串口、探针、烧录或加热操作。连续两次有证据修正仍失败，保存候选/失败日志交COORD重新裁决，不修改判据促通过。\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n[执行总表](../../../../docs/planning/vmware_soc_twin_task_execution_20261029.md) · [两阶段方案](../../../../docs/planning/vmware_soc_twin_development_plan_20261029.md)\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## 2026-10-29 独立通信模块与源码维护\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nENG-DBUS长期维护`soc-ap/middleware/dbus/`的公开API、真实SDK源码、独立模块CMake、示例及生成接入，并维护`config/dbus/twin/`、`tests/dbus/twin/`和`third_party/dbus/`的来源/准确版本/校验/许可证/补丁/配方。原始上游源码包沿用`third_party/archives/`，不另复制一套。模块代码纳入当前soc-ap仓和服务器候选，不依赖个人安装。\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n公共`third_party/build.sh`、总校验索引/总README及公共构建由INTEGRATOR按TWIN-04串行修改；本卡只提交自身模块配方/校验与集成请求，不越界修改公共文件。权威IDL/XML由ARCH在TWIN-02维护；业务Owner调用SDK，不私建另一套通信底座。\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n本次只更新计划/维护入口，尚未实现SDK。验收必须从服务器源码在独立沙箱重建并实际跨进程运行，不能以源码包、库文件或空壳目录存在替代。详见[模块维护规范](../../../../docs/planning/communication_modules_ownership_20261029.md)。\\\\\\\\n<!DOCTYPE node PUBLIC \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"-//freedesktop//DTD D-BUS Object Introspection 1.0//EN\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"http://www.freedesktop.org/standards/dbus/1.0/introspect.dtd\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n<!--\\\\\\\\n  Copyright (c) 2026 AI-SoC Project. All rights reserved.\\\\\\\\n  D-Bus Interface Introspection Specification (v2.0)\\\\\\\\n  Document: ICD-VMWARE-SOC-TWIN-20261029\\\\\\\\n  Task ID: TWIN-02\\\\\\\\n  Author: ARCH\\\\\\\\n-->\\\\\\\\n<node name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/org/aisoc\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n  <!-- ===================================================================== -->\\\\\\\\n  <!-- 1. Forward Service Interface (/org/aisoc/forward)                     -->\\\\\\\\n  <!-- ===================================================================== -->\\\\\\\\n  <interface name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"org.aisoc.ForwardInterface\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n    <!--\\\\\\\\n      TriggerQuery:\\\\\\\\n      Initiate an asynchronous temperature query (CMD_TEMP_QUERY = 0x14) to the target MCU.\\\\\\\\n      target_node: 1 = MC (Bed), 2 = TH (Tool/Extruder)\\\\\\\\n      timeout_ms: Transaction timeout in milliseconds (e.g., 200 ms for VMware, 50 ms for SoC)\\\\\\\\n      error_code: 0 = SUCCESS, <0 = error\\\\\\\\n      transaction_id: Monotonic sequence tracking id\\\\\\\\n    -->\\\\\\\\n    <method name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TriggerQuery\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"target_node\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"y\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" direction=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"in\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"timeout_ms\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"u\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" direction=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"in\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"error_code\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"i\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" direction=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"out\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"transaction_id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"u\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" direction=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"out\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n    </method>\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n    <!--\\\\\\\\n      GetPortStatus:\\\\\\\\n      Retrieve physical serial port operational metrics.\\\\\\\\n      is_open: True if the device handle is successfully opened\\\\\\\\n      port_path: Canonical device node path (e.g. /dev/ttyUSB0)\\\\\\\\n      tx_count: Cumulative transmitted frame counter\\\\\\\\n      rx_count: Cumulative received valid frame counter\\\\\\\\n    -->\\\\\\\\n    <method name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"GetPortStatus\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"is_open\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" direction=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"out\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"port_path\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"s\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" direction=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"out\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"tx_count\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"t\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" direction=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"out\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"rx_count\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"t\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" direction=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"out\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n    </method>\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n    <!--\\\\\\\\n      EmergencyStop:\\\\\\\\n      Broadcast an immediate high-priority emergency stop frame (CMD_EMERGENCY_STOP = 0x12)\\\\\\\\n      reason_code: Hardware or application emergency stop reason\\\\\\\\n      error_code: 0 = SUCCESS, <0 = error\\\\\\\\n    -->\\\\\\\\n    <method name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"EmergencyStop\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"reason_code\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"y\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" direction=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"in\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"error_code\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"i\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" direction=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"out\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n    </method>\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n    <!--\\\\\\\\n      ResetLink:\\\\\\\\n      Reset the communication session and sequence tracker for the specified node.\\\\\\\\n      target_node: 1 = MC, 2 = TH, 0xFF = All nodes\\\\\\\\n      error_code: 0 = SUCCESS, <0 = error\\\\\\\\n    -->\\\\\\\\n    <method name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ResetLink\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"target_node\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"y\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" direction=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"in\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"error_code\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"i\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" direction=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"out\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n    </method>\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n    <!-- Signal emitted when physical or logical link state transitions -->\\\\\\\\n    <signal name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"LinkStateChanged\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"node_id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"y\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"is_connected\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"reason\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"s\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n    </signal>\\\\\\\\n  </interface>\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n  <!-- ===================================================================== -->\\\\\\\\n  <!-- 2. Device Manager State Authority Interface (/org/aisoc/device)       -->\\\\\\\\n  <!-- ===================================================================== -->\\\\\\\\n  <interface name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"org.aisoc.DeviceInterface\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n    <!--\\\\\\\\n      GetSnapshot:\\\\\\\\n      Retrieve the authoritative consolidated system temperature snapshot in JSON format.\\\\\\\\n      snapshot_json: Serialized TemperatureSnapshot JSON payload\\\\\\\\n    -->\\\\\\\\n    <method name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"GetSnapshot\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"snapshot_json\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"s\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" direction=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"out\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n    </method>\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n    <!--\\\\\\\\n      RequestImmediateSample:\\\\\\\\n      Admit and trigger an immediate out-of-band sensor sampling transaction.\\\\\\\\n      source_type: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"bed\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"tool\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", or \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"all\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n      accepted: True if command admitted by state machine\\\\\\\\n      reason: Admission rejection explanation if accepted=false\\\\\\\\n    -->\\\\\\\\n    <method name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RequestImmediateSample\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"source_type\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"s\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" direction=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"in\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"accepted\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" direction=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"out\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"reason\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"s\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" direction=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"out\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n    </method>\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n    <!--\\\\\\\\n      GetDeviceState:\\\\\\\\n      Retrieve complete operational state machine summary (IDLE, HEATING, PRINTING, FAULT).\\\\\\\\n      state_json: Serialized device state JSON payload\\\\\\\\n    -->\\\\\\\\n    <method name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"GetDeviceState\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"state_json\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"s\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" direction=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"out\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n    </method>\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n    <!--\\\\\\\\n      EmergencyStop:\\\\\\\\n      State machine coordinated emergency stop invocation with heater shutdown and alarm latch.\\\\\\\\n      reason_code: Cause identifier\\\\\\\\n      error_code: 0 = SUCCESS, <0 = error\\\\\\\\n    -->\\\\\\\\n    <method name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"EmergencyStop\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"reason_code\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"y\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" direction=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"in\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"error_code\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"i\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" direction=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"out\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n    </method>\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n    <!-- Signal emitted on each authoritative snapshot update -->\\\\\\\\n    <signal name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"SnapshotUpdated\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"generation_id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"u\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"timestamp_ns\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"t\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n    </signal>\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n    <!-- Signal emitted on system operational state transitions -->\\\\\\\\n    <signal name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"DeviceStateChanged\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"old_state\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"s\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"new_state\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"s\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"reason\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"s\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n    </signal>\\\\\\\\n  </interface>\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n  <!-- ===================================================================== -->\\\\\\\\n  <!-- 3. Hardware Management Service (HMS) Interface (/org/aisoc/hms)       -->\\\\\\\\n  <!-- ===================================================================== -->\\\\\\\\n  <interface name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"org.aisoc.HmsInterface\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n    <!--\\\\\\\\n      GetActiveAlarms:\\\\\\\\n      Retrieve list of all latched active hardware and thermal alarms in JSON format.\\\\\\\\n      alarms_json: Serialized JSON array of active alarm descriptors\\\\\\\\n    -->\\\\\\\\n    <method name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"GetActiveAlarms\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"alarms_json\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"s\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" direction=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"out\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n    </method>\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n    <!--\\\\\\\\n      ClearAlarm:\\\\\\\\n      Acknowledge and clear a latched alarm if physical condition has normalized.\\\\\\\\n      alarm_id: Unique alarm incident identifier\\\\\\\\n      cleared: True if cleared, false if condition still active or permission denied\\\\\\\\n      reason: Diagnostic detail message\\\\\\\\n    -->\\\\\\\\n    <method name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ClearAlarm\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"alarm_id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"u\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" direction=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"in\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"cleared\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" direction=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"out\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"reason\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"s\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" direction=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"out\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n    </method>\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n    <!-- Signal emitted when a new alarm condition is raised -->\\\\\\\\n    <signal name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AlarmRaised\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"alarm_id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"u\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"node_id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"y\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"error_code\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"u\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"severity\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"s\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"s\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n    </signal>\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n    <!-- Signal emitted when an active alarm is acknowledged and cleared -->\\\\\\\\n    <signal name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AlarmCleared\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"alarm_id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"u\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n      <arg name=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"reason\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" type=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"s\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/>\\\\\\\\n    </signal>\\\\\\\\n  </interface>\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n</node>\\\\\\\\nproject-control/docs/planning/twin_reuse_matrix_20261029.md:42:| **ui-gateway** | `soc-ap/core/gateway/` | AP 主机 / SoC | 监听 HTTP 8080，转接 D-Bus/DDS | 源码复用率 $\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\ge 95\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\%$ | 需评估嵌入式系统静态资源 gzip 压缩与连接数上限 | `TWIN-09`<br/>`soc-ap/core/gateway/**` |\\\\\\\\nproject-control/doc