are_soc_twin_task_execution_20261029.md) · [两阶段方案](../../../../docs/planning/vmware_soc_twin_development_plan_20261029.md)\\n\\n\\n## 2026-10-29 独立通信模块与源码维护\\n\\nENG-DBUS长期维护`soc-ap/middleware/dbus/`的公开API、真实SDK源码、独立模块CMake、示例及生成接入，并维护`config/dbus/twin/`、`tests/dbus/twin/`和`third_party/dbus/`的来源/准确版本/校验/许可证/补丁/配方。原始上游源码包沿用`third_party/archives/`，不另复制一套。模块代码纳入当前soc-ap仓和服务器候选，不依赖个人安装。\\n\\n公共`third_party/build.sh`、总校验索引/总README及公共构建由INTEGRATOR按TWIN-04串行修改；本卡只提交自身模块配方/校验与集成请求，不越界修改公共文件。权威IDL/XML由ARCH在TWIN-02维护；业务Owner调用SDK，不私建另一套通信底座。\\n\\n本次只更新计划/维护入口，尚未实现SDK。验收必须从服务器源码在独立沙箱重建并实际跨进程运行，不能以源码包、库文件或空壳目录存在替代。详见[模块维护规范](../../../../docs/planning/communication_modules_ownership_20261029.md)。\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\nproject-control/docs/evidence/twin/TWIN-06/runs/run_03/codex_session.jsonl:36:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_17\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/bash -lc \\\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nimport json, hashlib\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nbase=Path('project-control/docs/evidence/twin/TWIN-06/runs/run_03/server_qa')\\nfor name in ['server_lock.json','checkout.log','runtime.log','server_verdict.json','server_qa.json']:\\n p=base/name\\n print(name, hashlib.sha256(p.read_bytes()).hexdigest())\\nprint('qa_session_head:')\\nfor line in Path('project-control/docs/evidence/twin/TWIN-06/runs/run_03/codex_session.jsonl').read_text().splitlines()[:5]: print(line[:600])\\nPY\\n\\\"\",\"aggregated_output\":\"server_lock.json beffe097cbf259d07058a8d12f2ee71bf1687559bab24292a645da03519be0fa\\ncheckout.log 4c66ff4eff798c986a7a28c7ea7f1499e9f053f161aba597a038101685882244\\nruntime.log 50f789c1695139aa72c1770806eddb064d727cce08a374913dbee69d03a37281\\nserver_verdict.json 3464eab338676378c5f85dc85bd1292ca006df135928361cf59bbe6045da97d5\\nserver_qa.json 1c5d727a72103a1b08e116dcbb568ac16a228da7aae5a0160fcdd4cded1690ea\\nqa_session_head:\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"thread.started\\\",\\\"thread_id\\\":\\\"01a18bc7-1aac-7451-83c7-b9c40bb8a